      "id": 1,
      "text": "The creek that gives Dardenne Prairie its name was likely christened by a French trapper in memory of the Ardennes forest in France.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
